==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|gewinnen}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|giwinnan}}, from {{inh|nl|gmw-pro|*gawinnan}}, from {{inh|nl|gem-pro|*gawinnaną}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|nl|Nl-gewinnen.ogg|audio}}
* {{hyphenation|nl|ge|win|nen}}
* {{rhyme|nl|ɪnən|s=3}}

===Verb===
{{nl-verb}} {{tlb|nl|archaic}}

# {{lb|nl|transitive|or|intransitive}} to [[acquire]]
## to [[acquire]] as the result of a [[struggle]] or [[contest]]
## to [[beget]]
##: {{ux|nl|Abraham '''gewon''' Isaac.|Abraham '''begat''' Isaac.}}

====Inflection====
{{nl-conj-st|class=3a|pref=ge|win|won|wonnen|winne|wonne}}

